# Transform Cards

## Summary
Host command — iterate over matching cards and run a command on each that transforms its json. Available to
cards and commands via the runtime loader, and to AI assistant rooms as a
tool.

## Example
```ts
import TransformCardsTool from '@cardstack/boxel-host/commands/transform-cards';

let result = await new TransformCardsTool(commandContext).execute({
  /* input fields */
} as any);
```
`commandContext` comes from `@context.commandContext` inside any card
format. In an AI room the same tool is invoked by name (action verb: Transform).
